    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Receipt of Responses",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quotation responses should be received through the Public Contracts Scotland (PCS) Quick Quote system. Quick Quote is a secure way to receive responses and can act as an audit trail if required. This is considered best practice.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where organisations do not use Quick Quote, quotation responses may be received in writing or by email. R emember to check your junk mail folder before and after the quotation deadline in case bids have been filtered by your email system.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Opening the Responses",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Opening the Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quotation responses should be opened in line with your organisation's governance arrangements. If your organisation does not use Quick Quote, you should formally record the quotation responses received using the Record of Quotations Received form.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Opening the Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If less than three quotation responses are returned, reasons should be sought from the supplie rs who did not submit a bid. This feedback should be retained on file and can be used as lessons learned for future quotations.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Opening the Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If only one response is received, please contact your local procurement team/Centre of Expertise (CoE) on how to proceed.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Opening the Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Evaluation of Responses",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should use the evaluation process and guidance template to score the responses. This evaluation will determine which bid best meets your requirements.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your evaluation should score the evaluation criteria you published in the Invitation to Quote documents .",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you need to seek clarification on any or all quotation responses, this should be sent in writing to the supplier(s). You should set a specific deadline for supplier(s) to respond with their answer(s) and treat all suppliers on an equal basis.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Abnormally Low Price Response",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Any quote which shows an abnormally low price may be queried with the supplier to identify the reason(s) for this. If this is due to supplier error, you should consult with your local procurement team or Centre of Expertise for further advice on how to proceed.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Alternative Terms and Conditions of Contract",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Alternative Terms and Conditions of Contract"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If any of the quotation responses are received with alternative Terms and Conditions (T&C’s) of Contract to those you published in your quotation, you must inform the supplier in writing that your original T&C’s of Contract apply.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Alternative Terms and Conditions of Contract"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If the supplier continues to challenge your Terms and Conditions of Contract, you should seek advice from your procurement or legal services tea m or, in their absence, your relevant Centre of Expertise .",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Alternative Terms and Conditions of Contract"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Supplier Interviews and Presentations",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Supplier Interviews and Presentations"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In exceptional circumstances, you may consider interviewing/inviting presentations from suppliers in order to assist in the evaluation of quotation responses. However if you decide to score a supplier presentation as part of the evaluation you should have s tated this in the Invitation to Quote d ocuments.",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Supplier Interviews and Presentations"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For supplier interviews/presentations, you should provide the suppliers with details of the time, place and format of any interview or presentation, ideally as part of the Invitation to Quote (ITQ).",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Supplier Interviews and Presentations"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "All suppliers should be treated equally. Suppliers should be provided with an equal opportunity for interview, presentation or site visits unless the initial evaluation undertaken shows that the supplier could not meet the Invitation to Quote core requirements.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Supplier Interviews and Presentations"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Records of the interviews/presentations should be kept for audit purposes.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Evaluation of Responses",
        "Abnormally Low Price Response",
        "Supplier Interviews and Presentations"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Recommendations Report",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Once the evaluation has finished you should comple te a recommendations report . This report is used to present your find ings and proposal to your manager/senior management team (in line with your organisation’s governance arrangements) for approval to proceed.",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The recommendations report should contain as a minimum:",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "A summary of the process undertaken",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Ensure any decisions for supplier disqualification are given",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Recommendation of award",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Request for approval",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The report should contain reference to the following:",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Summary of the process to date",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Ensure any decisions for supplier disqualification have been fully documented and that the paperwork is available for inspection",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Recommendation of award & request for approval",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Details of any risks still present and mitigation plans",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Receipt of Responses",
        "Recommendations Report"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "li",
